。\n\u200b最後必須特別點名那碗**「叉燒飯」**！炙烤過的肉塊鋪得滿滿的，醬汁超入味，簡直是白飯殺手，好吃到停不下來！來這裡強烈建議麵留點胃，絕對要加點這碗飯！",null,[0,109]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9866997981052450843/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvVUZSRk1IUk5hazVzVlVkS1JtRXdXVFJUUldReVpESTBNR013UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9866997981052450843/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvVUZSRk1IUk5hazVzVlVkS1JtRXdXVFJUUldReVpESTBNR013UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9866997981052450843/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvVUZSRk1IUk5hazVzVlVkS1JtRXdXVFJUUldReVpESTBNR013UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9866997981052450843/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvVUZSRk1IUk5hazVzVlVkS1JtRXdXVFJUUldReVpESTBNR013UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9866997981052450843/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvVUZSRk1IUk5hazVzVlVkS1JtRXdXVFJUUldReVpESTBNR013UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9866997981052450843/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhvVUZSRk1IUk5hazVzVlVkS1JtRXdXVFJUUldReVpESTBNR013UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2723,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoUFRFMHRNak5sVUdKRmEwWTRTRWQyZDI0MGMwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xc9f4e676f86f051a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlhPTE0tMjNlUGJFa0Y4SEd2d240c0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoUFRFMHRNak5sVUdKRmEwWTRTRWQyZDI0MGMwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoUFRFMHRNak5sVUdKRmEwWTRTRWQyZDI0MGMwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xoUFRFMHRNak5sVUdKRmEwWTRTRWQyZDI0MGMwRRILMGRnZHNuZlZMc2YaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09saFBURTB0TWpObFVHSkZhMFk0U0VkMmQyNDBjMEUSCzBkZ2RzbmZWTHNmIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARGgVv-Hbm9MkqCzBkZ2RzbmZWTHNm\u0026wv\u003d1\u002